    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You take on an air of arrogance, allowing you to distract and sway others with your apparent knowledge and experience. When you make a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check to change an enemy's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attitude\">Attitude</a>, the enemy takes a -5 penalty to its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> until the end of your next turn. If you spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>, the duration is extended to the end of the encounter. This is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mind-Affecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Affecting\">Mind-Affecting</a> effect.",
